<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 05.114  CrackOtto-New</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">by Ottorino Invernizzi</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Inspired by Crackerjack profile of Dennis Durham</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">18-08-2013</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">164 facets + 26 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">1-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
